  "title": "Easy Pumpkin Pie Cake",
  "description": "Canned pumpkin, spices, and a boxed cake mix work their magic to create this pumpkin pie-like cake which is filled and frosted with a cinnamon-cream cheese frosting.",
  "authors": [
    "Yoly"
  ],
